cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "A small fine-tuned LLM for on-premises PII redaction: what transfers and what doesn't"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Menkor
    given-names: Othmane
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Othocs/QLoRA-PII-Redaction"
abstract: >-
  A QLoRA-tuned Qwen3-1.7B PII span detector and a self-hosted redaction gateway
  (validators, normalisation, recall-first merge, policies, AES-256-GCM vault, FastAPI,
  Docker), evaluated blind with 3 seeds against Presidio, GLiNER-PII and OpenMed on
  synthetic, legal (TAB) and real customer-service (ABCD) text.
keywords: [PII, de-identification, redaction, LoRA, QLoRA, privacy, NER]
